              <div class="surface__desc">
                <p>
                  Ask Claude to bring a page up to date and you watch it edit: its words tinted, what it
                  removes ghosted, its cursor named. Your own saves wait for its turn to end.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Each one collects in a change request. Revert any one on its own; the wiki changes
                  only when a person merges, and each merge is pushed to a mirror you own.
                </p>
                <p class="surface__note">
                  Agents edit through the app's wiki tools, none of which can merge. So far we have
                  tried this with Claude.
                </p>
                <a class="link" href="https://app.astrolabe.sh">Open a wiki<svg class="arw" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow" /></svg></a>
